@intent The Last Sword's story, played stage by stage as a player would: the troubled blacksmith in a village and his scroll, the dragon cult's raid on that village and its victory, the secret letter that points to the Nether, the traveler's hold and its message, the End's ruins and sealed spire, freeing the Lost Wraith, the note that leads to the Wound of Time, and the queen's trial -- each stage gated on the advancement the mod grants for it
@continue-on-fail
@world flat structures
# The world is vanilla's superflat: the overworld has villages (enough for the blacksmith and the raid), and the Nether
# and the End generate normally, the mod's structures included. Travel is @goto (vanilla /locate); every stage's
# mechanic is the player's own doing. One stage is not reached here: the ruined village is placed only by the normal
# overworld's worldgen (and /place registers no structure, so its "discover" check would never fire).
# Stages run in order; a stage the one before it could not reach gets only the setup it needs, marked as such.

@step S1 welcome, and the village hint
gamemode survival
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
time set day
weather clear
gamerule doDaylightCycle false
gamerule doMobSpawning false
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 99999 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:regeneration 99999 1 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 99999 0 true
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={the_last_sword:the_last_sword_welcome=true}]
# 60 ticks after the welcome, the mod points to the nearest village
@expect chat message.the_last_sword.nearest_village_location within 10s
@shot welcome

@step S2 the troubled blacksmith appears in the village
# entering any village piece for the first time spawns him (a level-5 weaponsmith) and grants the stage
@goto structure #minecraft:village
@expect chat message.the_last_sword.troubled_blacksmith_intro within 10s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={the_last_sword:troubled_blacksmith=true}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:villager,nbt={VillagerData:{profession:"minecraft:weaponsmith",level:5}}]
@shot blacksmith

@step S3-S4 buy The Last End Scroll from him
# his first offer: 1 emerald for the scroll. Slots of the trade screen: 0-1 payment, 2 result, 30 the first hotbar slot
give @s minecraft:emerald 1
execute at @s rotated as @s run tp @e[type=minecraft:villager,nbt={VillagerData:{profession:"minecraft:weaponsmith",level:5}},limit=1,sort=nearest] ^ ^ ^2
execute as @e[type=minecraft:villager,nbt={VillagerData:{profession:"minecraft:weaponsmith",level:5}}] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
@wait 15t
@aim entity @e[type=minecraft:villager,nbt={VillagerData:{profession:"minecraft:weaponsmith",level:5}},limit=1,sort=nearest]
@wait 2t
@aim entity @e[type=minecraft:villager,nbt={VillagerData:{profession:"minecraft:weaponsmith",level:5}},limit=1,sort=nearest]
@key key.use
@expect screen Merchant within 3s
@shot trade-screen
@click slot 30
@click slot 0
@wait 5t
@click slot 2
@click slot 31
@wait 5t
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 1s
@assert execute if items entity @s container.* the_last_sword:the_last_end_scroll
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={the_last_sword:the_last_end_scroll_obtain=true}]
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={the_last_sword:mage_village_destination=true}]

@step S5 the ruined village (not reached here)
# placed only by the normal overworld's worldgen: a superflat world never has one, and /place would register nothing.
# The stage is checked where it can be: in a normal world (a separate run with @world normal)
@wait 1t

@step S6 a dragon crystal
# the stage takes a slot that changes to exactly 1 crystal; the ruined village's item frame is the story's source
give @s the_last_sword:dragon_crystal 1
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={the_last_sword:dragon_crystal_obtain=true}]

@step S7 the dragon cult attacks the village
# carrying a crystal inside the village starts the raid within 2 s (the quest handler's 40-tick check)
@expect bossbar raid.the_last_sword.dragon_cult_raid within 10s
@assert execute if entity @s[advancements={the_last_sword:dragon_cult_raid=true}]
@shot raid

@step S8 the raid is won
# three waves: 2 cultists; 1 paladin and 3 cultists; 1 priest, 2 paladins and 3 cultists, 15 s apart. Each raider is
# held still once it arrives (its fight is the raid's), then struck with the mod's sword; the paladins and the priest
# take many capped hits by design
item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with the_last_sword:the_last_sword_you_never_forgot
@wait 3s
# wave 1
execute as @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
execute as @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cult_paladin] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
execute as @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cult_priest] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
execute as @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
execute if entity @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist] at @s rotated as @s run tp @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist,limit=1,sort=nearest] ^ ^ ^2
@wait 5t
@aim entity the_last_sword:dragon_cultist if-present
@key key.attack
@wait 10t
execute as @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
execute if entity @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist] at @s rotated as @s run tp @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist,limit=1,sort=nearest] ^ ^ ^2
@wait 5t
@aim entity the_last_sword:dragon_cultist if-present
@key key.attack
@wait 10t
execute as @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
execute if entity @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist] at @s rotated as @s run tp @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist,limit=1,sort=nearest] ^ ^ ^2
@wait 5t
@aim entity the_last_sword:dragon_cultist if-present
@key key.attack
@wait 10t
execute as @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
execute if entity @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist] at @s rotated as @s run tp @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist,limit=1,sort=nearest] ^ ^ ^2
@wait 5t
@aim entity the_last_sword:dragon_cultist if-present
@key key.attack
@wait 10t
# finish any raider left with the sword's ranged shot (right click: one-shot, no reach needed)
@aim entity the_last_sword:dragon_cultist if-present
@key key.use
@wait 15t
@aim entity the_last_sword:dragon_cult_paladin if-present
@key key.use
@wait 15t
@aim entity the_last_sword:dragon_cult_priest if-present
@key key.use
@wait 15t
@aim entity the_last_sword:dragon_cultist if-present
@key key.use
@wait 15t
@aim entity the_last_sword:dragon_cult_paladin if-present
@key key.use
@wait 15t
@aim entity the_last_sword:dragon_cult_priest if-present
@key key.use
@wait 15t
@wait 17s
# wave 2
execute as @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cultist] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
execute as @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cult_paladin] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
execute as @e[type=the_last_sword:dragon_cult_priest] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:1b}
